  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Plot routine of the disc: draws the row circle_y_down and the row circle_y_up from circle_x_right to circle_x_left with the span routine at $285b. It skips a row outside 0-draw_max_y. It keeps shape_x0, shape_y0 and shape_x1. When circle_y_offset is 0, it returns from the caller of circle_plot."},
    {"at":14,"placement":"side","text":"Clip X: $fe gives 0."},
    {"at":27,"placement":"side","text":"Skip the row when Y > draw_max_y (also $fe and $ff)."},
    {"at":38,"placement":"side","text":"Span from shape_x0 to shape_x1 on row shape_y0."},
    {"at":90,"placement":"side","text":"Drop the return address of circle_plot: the circle is complete."},
    {"at":94,"placement":"line","text":"Clips a circle X coordinate. Input A: X, $fe (below 0) or $ff (above draw_max_x). Output A: 0 for $fe, draw_max_x for $ff, else X."},
    {"at":107,"placement":"line","text":"Plot routine of the circle outline: plots the four points (circle_x_right, circle_y_down), (circle_x_right, circle_y_up), (circle_x_left, circle_y_down) and (circle_x_left, circle_y_up) with plot_point_xy. It skips a point outside the drawing area. When circle_y_offset is 0, it returns from the caller of circle_plot."},
    {"at":221,"placement":"side","text":"Drop the return address of circle_plot: the circle is complete."},
    {"at":224,"placement":"line","text":"Calculates the four circle coordinates from the centre (shape_x0, shape_y0), circle_x_offset and circle_y_offset: circle_x_right/left = shape_x0 +/- 3/4 * circle_x_offset, circle_y_down/up = shape_y0 +/- circle_y_offset. A coordinate below 0 becomes $fe, a coordinate above draw_max_x or draw_max_y becomes $ff."},
    {"at":224,"placement":"side","text":"temp_word = 3 * circle_x_offset."},
    {"at":248,"placement":"side","text":"temp_word / 4."},
    {"at":444,"placement":"line","text":"circle_error = circle_error + 2 * circle_x_offset."},
    {"at":469,"placement":"line","text":"circle_error = circle_error - 2 * circle_y_offset."},
    {"at":494,"placement":"line","text":"circle_error = circle_error + 1."},
    {"at":501,"placement":"line","text":"Plots the current brush at X = X register, Y = Y register with the plot routine at $2811. cursor_x and cursor_y do not change."}
  ],
